Z||000004||ChadMan||12-30-1999||09:57 AM||||Gotta agree with the monochromatic red paint, Shiner - never saw one that wasn't beautiful.  But I'm partial to the black diamond-spoke wheels over the gold (unless you go with medium red metallic).  Just my 2 cents.<P>The monochromatic medium red metallic looks good, too.||||reg||14
Z||000005||Scott2M4||12-30-1999||10:17 AM||||I was going to say yellow until I re-read your post and saw that the car has a tan interior.<P>How about the Bright Pewter Metallic found on the C5 Vettes?  It would look INCREDIBLE with the tan interior and the newly painted gold rims!||||reg||4
